title: 'pallet-proxy: refund unused weight of the proxied call'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `proxy` and `proxy_announced` now refund the unused weight of the proxied call: they return the
    proxy overhead plus the actual weight reported by the proxied call. If the proxied call does not
    report its actual weight, the full declared weight is charged as before. `pays_fee` stays
    `Pays::Yes`.

    `Config::RuntimeCall` now requires `Dispatchable<PostInfo = PostDispatchInfo>`. `RuntimeCall`
    generated by `construct_runtime!` already satisfies it. The encoding of calls does not change.
crates:
- name: pallet-proxy
  bump: major
